# Node feature names for GPU models (jobs pick models with --constraint=NAME). bin/add_node
# derives a name from nvidia-smi's, eg. "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 SUPER" -> rtx_2080_super; a line
# here renames it everywhere: <derived name> = <feature>, eg.
#   rtx_2080_super = 2080s
# Takes effect when each machine's cron reruns render_config (within a minute of pulling), then
# scontrol reconfigure on the controller.
